            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-card border border-border rounded-[10px] p-4 cursor-pointer">
            <summary class="font-display text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              Can I use UGC platform content for paid ads?
              <span class="text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[18px]">+</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 leading-[1.6] mt-3">
              Yes, but verify the usage rights included with your purchase. Most platforms offer organic usage rights by default and charge extra for paid media licensing. Insense simplifies this with built-in Spark Ads and whitelisting support. Always confirm geographic scope, duration, and platform restrictions before running paid campaigns with UGC content.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-card border border-border rounded-[10px] p-4 cursor-pointer">
            <summary class="font-display text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              What&rsquo;s the difference between a UGC platform and a UGC agency?
              <span class="text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[18px]">+</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 leading-[1.6] mt-3">
              A UGC platform provides the infrastructure &mdash; creator marketplace, payment processing, basic project management. A UGC agency provides the expertise &mdash; content strategy, creative direction, performance optimization, and production management. Platforms are tools; agencies are partners. Most brands start with platforms and graduate to agencies as their UGC spend grows and performance expectations increase.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-card border border-border rounded-[10px] p-4 cursor-pointer">
            <summary class="font-display text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              How do I evaluate UGC creator quality on a platform?
              <span class="text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[18px]">+</span>
            </summary>
            <p class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 leading-[1.6] mt-3">
